# What a git-based `docker build` (the GitHub-triggered Cloud Build) must NOT copy into the image.
# The API needs only: api.py, features.py, forecasting.py, district_forecast.py, model_metrics.json,
# crop_yield_model_v3.pkl, master_dataset_*.csv, the three extra/*.csv it reports, and serving/.
# deploy/stage_build.py lists the same files for local checks.
.git
.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.claude
.impeccable
.gitignore
.python-version
frontend
figures
data
pipeline
deploy
extra/*
!extra/baseline_comparison.csv
!extra/ablation_study_results.csv
!extra/stage3_model_comparison_results.csv
*.ipynb
*.docx
*.docm
*.pdf
*.md
app.py
run_app.bat
test_*.py
train_v3.py
requirements-data.txt
crop_yield_model_v2_extra_trees.pkl
